      "updated": 1790685271342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key: Process-per-connection model. Postmaster forks a dedicated Backend for each client.\nBackground processes handle maintenance (checkpoints, vacuum, WAL, stats). All share memory for buffers & coordination.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key: Process-per-connection model. Postmaster forks a dedicated Backend for each client.\nBackground processes handle maintenance (checkpoints, vacuum, WAL, stats). All share memory for buffers & coordination.",
